{"id":"1295a6247dce7cb1","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Behavior Strategy System","display":"df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system — ZFC Game4 Behavior Strategy System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system — ZFC Game4 Behavior Strategy System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-game]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system — ZFC Game4 Behavior Strategy System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A\\in V\">\\(H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in P\">\\(i\\in P\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal I\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal I\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (auxiliary predicate defined here, with the player carrier explicit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land i\\in P\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\})\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\}\n\\land\\forall J,J&#39;\\in\\mathcal I\\;\n(J\\neq J&#39;\\to J\\cap J&#39;=\\varnothing)\n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land i\\in P\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\})\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\}\n\\land\\forall J,J&#39;\\in\\mathcal I\\;\n(J\\neq J&#39;\\to J\\cap J&#39;=\\varnothing)\n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}behavior\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\n(H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\ni\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists B_A,B_b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,H,B_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal I,B_b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall h,h&#39;\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h&#39;))\n\\land\\exists h\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}(A(h),\\mathcal P(A(h)),b(I))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}behavior\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\n(H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\ni\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists B_A,B_b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,H,B_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal I,B_b)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall h,h&#39;\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h&#39;))\n\\land\\exists h\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}(A(h),\\mathcal P(A(h)),b(I))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The player carrier is an explicit information-partition argument; the auxiliary predicate can no longer choose an unrelated codomain for the turn function.</li>\n<li>The action correspondence is constant on each information set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> is a genuine set function assigning a probability measure on that common action set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-game","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}information\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land i\\in P\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\})\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal I\n\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal I=\\{h\\in H:\\operatorname{turn}(h)=i\\}\n\\land\\forall J,J'\\in\\mathcal I\\;\n(J\\neq J'\\to J\\cap J'=\\varnothing)\n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}behavior\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4BehaviorStrategySystem}_S\n(H,P,i,\\mathcal I,b,\\operatorname{turn},A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\ni\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{turn},H,P)\n\\land\\operatorname{InformationPartition}_S(\\mathcal I,H,i,\\operatorname{turn},P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists B_A,B_b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(A,H,B_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal I,B_b)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall h,h'\\in I\\;(A(h)=A(h'))\n\\land\\exists h\\in I\\;\n\\mathrm{ProbabilitySpace}(A(h),\\mathcal P(A(h)),b(I))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"b","display":false}],"bytes":2284,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system.md|58-df-zfc-game4-behavior-strategy-system]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","545b51e7aa011030","36d7463d215be751","2a48a890cd9aeba0","0578a357a86e9d8f"]}